	(text "current-reference — Waveshare COTS wiring\\nFirmware pins: src/hw/pins_esp32_waveshare.h\\nBTN=GPIO2 LED=GPIO4 BUSY=25 RST=26 DC=27\\nSPI SCK=13 MISO=12 MOSI=14 CS=15\\nPanel: GDEH0154Z90 controller SSD1681\\nHV boost lives on the Waveshare driver board (NC on panel symbol)\\nReference schematic only — not a fabrication PCB"
